      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the draft. It looks professional, but I just ran it through a quick test of the council's tool and the score was... well, it was basically zero. It didn't catch the \"individual focus\" at all because the word \"citizen\" didn't even appear once. \n\nWe really need to bump that score up or it won't even make it to the human reviewers. Could you do a second pass? Try to integrate the term \"citizen\" more naturally throughout the text so the optimizer picks it up, but seriously, please don't make it look like you're just keyword-stuffing. It still has to read like a high-quality planning document.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
